---
// Section 3: three steps on one track, each ending in what the visitor will see.
const bars = [6, 14, 9, 18, 12, 22, 8, 16, 20, 10, 15, 7, 19, 12, 9, 17, 11, 6, 13, 8];
---

<section class="steps wrap" aria-labelledby="como">
  <h2 id="como">Pronto sem você aprender sistema.</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <h3>Conecte seu WhatsApp</h3>
      <p>Mesmo número. Você continua respondendo pelo app no celular quando quiser.</p>
      <div class="art pill" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span><strong>Seu número de sempre</strong><small>conectado · WhatsApp oficial</small></span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <h3>Mande um áudio</h3>
      <p>
        Conte serviços, preços e horários. A gente configura, e você testa e aprova antes de ligar
        qualquer coisa.
      </p>
      <div class="art voice" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="play" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M3 1.5v11l9-5.5z"></path></svg>
        <span class="wave">{bars.map((h) => <i style={`height:${String(h)}px`} />)}</span>
        <small>1:12</small>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <h3>O assistente atende</h3>
      <p>Responde, marca no seu Google Agenda e lembra o paciente da consulta.</p>
      <div class="art event" aria-hidden="true">
        <strong>Avaliação · qui., 15:00</strong>
        <small>Lembrete enviado 1 dia e 2 horas antes</small>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    padding-top: 96px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }
  ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
  }
  li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0 0 40px 48px;
  }
  li:not(:last-child)::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 15px;
    top: 36px;
    bottom: 4px;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }
  .n {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--action);
    color: var(--action-ink);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 38ch;
  }
  .art {
    margin-top: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--elevation);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 18px;
  }
  .art small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--jade);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--jade-soft);
  }
  .voice {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-bubble);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
  }
  .play {
    flex: none;
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .wave {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    height: 24px;
  }
  .wave i {
    width: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .event {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--jade-soft);
    border-color: var(--jade);
  }
  .event small {
    color: var(--jade-ink);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .steps {
      padding-top: 144px;
    }
    ol {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
    li {
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
      padding: 56px 0 0;
    }
    li:not(:last-child)::before {
      left: 48px;
      right: -20px;
      top: 16px;
      bottom: auto;
      width: auto;
      height: 1px;
    }
    .art {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
